  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"se-viewer se-theme-default\" lang=\"ko-KR\">\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_START -->\n    <!--@CONTENTS_HEADER-->\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_END -->\n    <div class=\"se-main-container\">\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-4ff8e93b-b032-11ee-b9b6-1360f288795b\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4ff8e956-b032-11ee-b9b6-2d354302724d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4ff8e957-b032-11ee-b9b6-ed1bf82a6f9a\">오늘 쇼츠를 쓰기 위해 몇가지 자료를 봤는데, 재밌는 사실이 있어서 적어본다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a42c90ec-2e5e-42ad-a0bd-6a42ead3abe8\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-c4dceee2-e5e6-4a68-8094-112fec83787a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1c37a6e6-0eb1-4920-8e26-edc13f594908\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7c1b2d08-1c5a-4c0b-a4b1-ce3c0b2aaf44\"><b>​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-efeb44b3-73f6-4384-bcf2-d6a6379b1f08\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-2962ecd8-7b54-4ff4-ae27-24c12af6a70e\"><b>​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1391472e-57a1-43d9-949d-3bf014931df2\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-ff445683-0289-46c0-9355-e8e832d7be48\"><b>​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7f6d0098-f61a-42c4-82a1-bbc2a2eca2ae\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-e107ec41-eec7-47ef-a165-34382f8f084c\">1. 인구는 줄고 있는데, 부자는 늘고 있다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-09a22c00-a7be-4292-af31-3e6adf4cf2c9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-006110a7-4ce3-45c7-a597-ff6ada7412d3\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-327fa59a-07d9-4883-856a-f21e3c81eb05\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a8a7e4c6-e51c-48d6-8900-17f7ddbf1600\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-00b4ac4f-5097-4aec-8fd6-492925f98f92\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-8c0cee63-48ca-47d2-bcbb-7b68f54c372c\">KB그룹에서 발표한 자료에 따르면, 2022년 한국에서 &#x27;부자&#x27; 라고 말하는 사람은 42만 4천명이었다. 2023년 12월에 발표한 자료에 따르면 45만 6천명으로 작년대비 3만 2천명(7.5%)가 늘었다. 365일로 나눴을때 하루에 평균 87명씩 부자가 되고 있다는 소리다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0e2e9d89-f5ce-4c3b-a930-cea8db0016b5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4d96f52c-c473-4603-bf6d-34c2f3b0506b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bf3b8c21-c895-4429-8ad7-98319a1b52cb\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-73224d50-6e58-43ba-8434-aec58f7a4e20\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4584f239-f078-4007-a664-ad4d84d209bf\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-858b7a63-b074-4bc1-b313-9065185acd16\">여기서 부자란 금융자산이 10억원 이상 보유한 개인을 말한다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style