module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-572f37a1-f732-4ac4-bb6c-686df09a2414\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b47257dc-f19e-4677-8603-e61df768bb98\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c4ee9762-fc5e-4f27-a394-14733571b59c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-1419d451-6ce6-42f6-aa6d-8b2e44c89fcf\">2019년이후 매년 약 3만~4만명씩 늘어왔다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6ba121e5-5ba9-4839-8e69-16d6e20128dc\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-bfe1ec5c-0e69-4bad-af94-af0f02f1b114\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b5b9d147-1809-441c-8ee1-ab98d3a2911b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-8808be3b-8a3a-4d0d-90a3-de774b34577b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2717e201-06e6-4a9f-99d0-8b1738a0a771\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-de850b02-3541-4696-87a5-c55e255f3322\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c8ea7d58-6865-426c-8949-c7ee80e124fe\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e79c0e16-09d5-4e66-885f-f5fcc657fe2b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ae0834e3-f80c-42d4-9d6f-dde692bfa728\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-bd8926a9-4c27-4a6b-8680-8251d8b59254\">그니깐 2019년이후 현금 10억이 된 사람이 하루에 90명이상씩 생기고 있다는 것이다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e